"Inner Temple of the Monk Order"
"This is the inner temple of the monks.  Here, monks reach complete communion

with their deity.  The holy symbols of the monks lie on shelves around the

room, neatly arranged on shelves and pedestals.  The shelves are extensions

from the pure redwood walls.  A peculiar text lies upon a dark table in the

corner.  The floor is pure marble, and amazingly is a single piece.  There is

a staircase leading down.

"
